    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Liam Reilly Auctioneers are delighted to present No. 35 Carton Court, a spacious six-bedroom semi-detached residence ideally positioned within one of Maynooth's most mature and sought-after residential developments.\n\nExtending to generous family proportions, this well-maintained home offers exceptional accommodation throughout and presents an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a substantial property in an unrivalled location. While the property has been well cared for over the years, it would benefit from some modernisation and upgrading, allowing the successful purchaser to create a truly outstanding family home tailored to their own taste and requirements.\n\nThe accommodation is bright, versatile and ideally suited to modern family living.\n\nGround Floor\n•Entrance Hall\n•Sitting Room 4.6m x 2.4m\n•Living Room 5.2m x 3.5m\n•Guest W.C.\n•Kitchen 3.6m x 2.9m\n•Office / Study 3.4m x 2.8m\n•Extended Living Space 4.9m x 4.6m\n•Bedroom 5 2.7m x 2.7m\n•Bedroom 6 2.7m x 1.9m\n\nFirst Floor\n•Master Bedroom 4.2m x 4.1m\n•Ensuite\n•Bedroom 2 3.3m x 3.1m\n•Bedroom 3 3.9m x 2.6m\n•Bedroom 4 3.1m x 2.2m\n•Family Bathroom 2.1m x 1.7m\n\nCarton Court is widely recognised as one of Maynooth's most established and desirable residential developments. The estate enjoys a mature setting with attractive green areas and is particularly popular with families due to its peaceful environment and exceptional convenience. The property is within a short stroll of Maynooth Town Centre, where an extensive range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities are available. Maynooth University, the M4 Motorway and the town's excellent public transport links, including the train station, are all within easy walking distance, making this an ideal location for commuters travelling to Dublin and beyond.\n\nMaynooth has become one of the most sought-after residential towns in the Greater Dublin Area, offering an enviable balance of vibrant town living, excellent educational facilities and outstanding transport connectivity. The town continues to attract families and professionals alike, with an abundance of sporting clubs, scenic walks, local amenities and a strong community atmosphere.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in a prime residential location, offering enormous potential for modernisation and value enhancement. Early viewing is highly recommended through the sole selling agents Liam Reilly Auctioneers.\n\n\nLIAM REILLY AUCTIONEERS give notice that all descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them.\n\n\n"
      },
